WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:01.292
I’m Krissette.

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.127
And I’m Kenise.

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.212
We watched Shrek.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.384
The movie’s about...

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:11.928
(laughing)

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:14.889
Shrek and Donkey getting Fiona.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.892
He wants children and to get married.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:19.561
No, he wants his swamp.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.312
Yeah, my swamp!

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:23.732
Shrek.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:25.859
Because he has the grumpy feet.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.903
and he always has the grumpy voice.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:32.532
Shrek!

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.033
Donkey!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.242
What?

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:35.368
She’s dramatic.

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:36.786
You can't do this to me, Shrek. 

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:37.871
I'm too young for you to die. 

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.874
And because she always faints.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:49.132
To have confidence and 
to  be yourself,

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:50.884
and to be okay with that.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.804
Because...

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:55.805
Because...

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:56.306
Oh!

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:56.931
It's funny.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.686
The Gingerbread Man did this. 

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.271
Now tell me,
where are the others?

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:04.814
Eat me! (spits)

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:08.026
(laughing)

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.989
When you sell your movie 
and you get rewards.

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:13.573
No.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:17.577
The people that made the sound of
the characters get awards.

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.955
(in unison)
I'll give Shrek an award

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:22.040
(in unison)
for music.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.001
(laughing)

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:28.838
(in unison)
You’re welcome. Goodbye.

